{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FL8S5XX61LgTqgNagCqW7v","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-3/projects/irt_personfit_contam/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# irt_personfit_contam — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-20 08:27 UTC | 更新原因: MVP 通过, 进入 research 阶段; 引用 paper_framing.md + experiment_plan.yaml; Dream 已启动\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n用 IRT person-fit 统计量在 information access 谱系最底层（仅 binary response pattern，无需 logits/weights/training data）检测 LLM benchmark 污染。详见 `paper_framing.md`。\\\\n\\\\n## 目标会议\\\\n- **Primary**: EMNLP 2026（用户确认 \\\\\\\"emnlp可行\\\\\\\"；ARR submission DDL 5/25 — 已追问可行性，等回复）\\\\n- **Fallback**: AAAI 2027 (abstract 7/21, full paper 7/28, ~10 weeks)\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段: Research（MVP 已通过 2026-05-20）\\\\n\\\\n### MVP 结果摘要\\\\n- **Phase A (simulation)**: Null check ✅, MMLU power@15%=97.9%, power ∝ n_items\\\\n- **Phase B (real data)**: Gemini-1.5 MMLU acc=1.0/θ=0.78/lz*=+34.75（全面污染信号）; 所有 benchmark SD >> 0.5; 多模型 lz* < -1.96\\\\n- **关键发现**: 需双侧检测（full contamination → lz* >> 0, partial → lz* << 0）\\\\n- **Inverted-U**: 仅 MMLU/HellaSwag 在 50% 以内展现真正下降（Reviewer 修正）\\\\n\\\\n### Core Claims (from paper_framing.md)\\\\n1. **Minimal-information detection**: Person-fit stats 在检测前沿最底层 work\\\\n2. **Detection characterization**: Power ∝ n_items + 双侧信号结构 + inverted-U 理论化\\\\n3. **Empirical prevalence**: Gemini-1.5 case study + 跨模型/跨 benchmark 污染模式\\\\n\\\\n### Experiment Plan Status (from experiment_plan.yaml)\\\\n**P0 (headline)**:\\\\n- [ ] `exp-two-sided` — 双侧检测框架（CPU, 进行中）\\\\n- [ ] `exp-extended-sim` — 扩展模拟 60-100%（CPU, 进行中）\\\\n- [ ] `exp-ctrl-contam` — 控制实验 Qwen3.5-9B + Gemma-4-31B（~80 GPU-hrs, depends on two-sided）\\\\n- [ ] `exp-power-theory` — Power 理论推导（CPU, depends on extended-sim）\\\\n\\\\n**P1 (robustness)**:\\\\n- [ ] `exp-leaderboard-audit` — Open LLM Leaderboard v1 扫描（~20 GPU-hrs）\\\\n- [ ] `exp-4pl-ablation` — 4PL vs 3PL 检测对比（CPU）\\\\n- [ ] `exp-baseline-comparison` — vs ConStat/Min-K%++（~30 GPU-hrs）\\\\n- [ ] `exp-multiscale-lzm` — 跨 benchmark 聚合统计量（CPU）\\\\n\\\\n**P2 (expanded scope)**:\\\\n- [ ] `exp-post-rl` — Post-RL 假设检验（~40 GPU-hrs）\\\\n- [ ] `exp-extra-benchmarks` — BBH/MATH 扩展（~10 GPU-hrs）\\\\n- [ ] `exp-domain-analysis` — MMLU domain-level 分析（CPU）\\\\n\\\\n### Dream 状态\\\\n- `dream_20260520T082549`: pending（full review mode），等待回调后再批准 P0 实验\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等 Dream 回调 → 审阅模拟审稿 → 决定是否调整 framing/plan\\\\n- [ ] exp-two-sided 重分析（Agent 执行中）\\\\n- [ ] exp-extended-sim 扩展模拟（Agent 执行中）\\\\n- [ ] GPU 服务器 bjb2-36806 环境配置（Agent 执行中）\\\\n- [ ] 确认目标会议（等用户回复 EMNLP DDL 问题）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 已分配: 4× RTX 5090 32GB (bjb2-36806)\\\\n- P0: ~80 GPU-hrs | P1: ~50 GPU-hrs | P2: ~50 GPU-hrs | Total: ~180 GPU-hrs\\\\n- 当前使用: 0（环境配置中）\\\\n\\\\n## 12 模型身份 (PSN-IRT)\\\\n| ID | θ | Model | 异常信号 |\\\\n|----|---|-------|---------|\\\\n| 0 | 1.46 | 360GPT2-Pro | — |\\\\n| 1 | 3.77 | DeepSeek-V3 | θ 远超第二名 |\\\\n| 2 | 1.14 | Doubao-pro | — |\\\\n| 3 | 0.78 | **Gemini-1.5** | **MMLU acc=1.0, lz*=+34.75** |\\\\n| 4 | -3.38 | Gemma-2B-it | — |\\\\n| 5 | 1.73 | Hunyuan-Turbo | — |\\\\n| 6 | -1.37 | Mistral-7B-v0.1 | — |\\\\n| 7 | 0.93 | Moonshot-v1 | — |\\\\n| 8 | 0.96 | Qwen-Plus | — |\\\\n| 9 | -0.13 | Qwen2.5-3B | — |\\\\n| 10 | -1.89 | Vicuna-7B-v1.3 | — |\\\\n| 11 | 0.77 | Yi-Lightning | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D007 | 2026-05-20 | 采纳方向 B: real data 上 person-fit 绝对阈值失效（universal mi | exp-two-sided |\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-20 | Phase B 必须用 benchmark-specific θ (MLE)，不能用 PSN-IRT | exp-two-sided |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-20 | Phase B Pass + 发现双侧检测需求: Model 3 MMLU 100% acc/lz* | sim_001, phase_b_personfit |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-20 | Phase A Partial Pass: 方法机制验证成功，power 随 n_items 递减为 | sim_001 |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-20 | 修正 benchmark 分类: ARC-C 降为小(295 items); MVP 不混用 Tru | — |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-20 | 根据 Reviewer 审查细化 MVP: 加入 PSN-IRT 参数 null distribut | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-20 | MVP 采用两阶段验证: Phase A 模拟验证（无GPU）+ Phase B 真实数据探测 | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3490, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xt1zaeExpqax3RABarmAFD","session_id":"f4a2a993-0191-4885-9fcd-ec0afed74d7e","uuid":"1ee82a4e-70ec-406c-ad10-b2a78b50aad7","timestamp":"2026-05-20T09:20:54.053Z"}
