{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016aPxVtfyezh49UBPysWZCc","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 irt_personfit_contam 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (3 个)\\n\\n- **exp-two-sided**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **phase_b_personfit**: DONE (success) — \\n- **sim_001**: DONE (negative) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-20\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n（无）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp-two-sided** (negative): Two-sided detection (|lz*| > threshold) with benchmark-specific θ MLE + parametric bootstrap empirical null + BH-FDR control will reduce Phase B flagging rate from 93% to a reasonable level (<20%), isolating genuine contamination signals from θ estimation bias ← 基于 phase_b_personfit\\n- **phase_b_personfit** (success): Real LLM benchmark response data from PSN-IRT 12 models shows significant inter-model variation in person-fit statistics (lz*, outfit, infit), with specific models exhibiting anomalous patterns indicative of benchmark contamination — particularly Gemini-1.5 with accuracy-ability dissociation\\n- **sim_001** (negative): Under 4PL IRT model, lz* person-fit statistic can detect partial benchmark contamination (5-30% items) with >80% power at α=0.05, and detection power follows an inverted-U curve across contamination levels (low contamination undetectable, moderate contamination most detectable, high contamination mimics high ability)\\n  [null_check_summary](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_personfit_contam/artifacts/sim_001/data/null_check_summary.json) | [simulation_summary](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_personfit_contam/artifacts/sim_001/data/simulation_summary.json) | [power_curves_combined](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_personfit_contam/artifacts/sim_001/chart/power_curves.png)\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 1 / 负向 2 / 失败 0 / 共 3\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nbjb2-36806: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n（无）\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01En1kVQUJJTG4HeGYPxDtMX",